                    {
                        "translation_id": "43d57727-b56e-4af9-803a-4ea098030cf5",
                        "source_entry_id": "14525efa-94a8-3b50-b51a-8c93f67ced8e",
                        "source_sense_id": "a5f4bec0-83c6-3ee5-ac11-a63d6afb9d1d",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein Hinweis, der schriftlich, optisch oder akustisch vor etwas warnt",
                        "target_lang_word": "warning",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "warning",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d18326c2-adc0-3421-9d3b-b2789cc5020a",
                                        "entry_id": "e15b9947-7123-3eed-b748-ac07747bacae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle of warn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "714d661c-5c3e-47b7-abf9-ad190e201b43",
                                                "sense_id": "d18326c2-adc0-3421-9d3b-b2789cc5020a",
                                                "text": "Although the Celebrity was almost impervious to sarcasm, he was now beginning to exhibit visible signs of uneasiness,[…]. It was with a palpable relief that he heard the first warning notes of the figure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "warning",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "196576a3-8eb3-3c89-9b36-3945c174bf34",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6f05bc-cb42-3439-805c-3816cb415f62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The action of the verb warn; an instance of warning someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17291c83-c313-47a7-a4f1-edf0f88351a5",
                                                "sense_id": "196576a3-8eb3-3c89-9b36-3945c174bf34",
                                                "text": "“[…] Churchill, my dear fellow, we have such greedy sharks, and wolves in lamb's clothing. Oh, dear, there's so much to tell you, so many warnings to give you, but all that must be postponed for the moment.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8cf8cff-826a-4628-8105-aca963a5443d",
                                                "sense_id": "196576a3-8eb3-3c89-9b36-3945c174bf34",
                                                "text": "Without much warning, a deep voice addressed the crowd, calling for a reverent silence as the Texans who died at the Alamo battle were named."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c95bb4b0-520c-3649-9d00-cfdc0fd2923e",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6f05bc-cb42-3439-805c-3816cb415f62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something spoken or written that is intended to warn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba0af597-65be-4afe-ba9c-d882551eb4ae",
                                                "sense_id": "c95bb4b0-520c-3649-9d00-cfdc0fd2923e",
                                                "text": "The boss gave him a warning that he would be fired if he did not desist from his behaviour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c93e111d-0d40-4721-b7c8-894656861fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "c95bb4b0-520c-3649-9d00-cfdc0fd2923e",
                                                "text": "Risk is everywhere. From tabloid headlines insisting that coffee causes cancer (yesterday, of course, it cured it) to stern government warnings about alcohol and driving, the world is teeming with goblins."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "warning",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c37516c-a253-390b-9fa4-9042ffe011c4",
                                        "entry_id": "2d4e0929-e6de-3aeb-804f-e049992d6a75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to warn of danger in signs and notices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba62447e-a5f2-4ba5-ab0d-f57e466d8fe7",
                        "source_entry_id": "14525efa-94a8-3b50-b51a-8c93f67ced8e",
                        "source_sense_id": "a5f4bec0-83c6-3ee5-ac11-a63d6afb9d1d",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein Hinweis, der schriftlich, optisch oder akustisch vor etwas warnt",
                        "target_lang_word": "avertissement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "avertissement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ed49ab0-109a-39b6-8bfd-a1f86c9cf37d",
                                        "entry_id": "7dfebd23-d646-3dfd-a082-68bb7bb10e5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avis qu’on donne à quelqu’un de quelque chose, afin qu’il y prenne garde."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc832f68-e7e1-46e0-bdbb-afb1e603b9ba",
                                                "sense_id": "3ed49ab0-109a-39b6-8bfd-a1f86c9cf37d",
                                                "text": "Beautrelet détacha la corde. À l’arbre de gauche autour duquel elle était attachée, un petit papier était fixé par une ficelle. Il le déplia et lut :\nTroisième et dernier avertissement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "505ec6ae-4f0a-4bae-80b3-a0bb59635284",
                                                "sense_id": "3ed49ab0-109a-39b6-8bfd-a1f86c9cf37d",
                                                "text": "Au contraire, depuis que nous nous sommes mis à travailler ensemble il m’est venu toutes sortes d’idées et je regarde les choses autrement, comme si les animaux et les fleurs étaient des princes enchantés que je dois désempapilloter, et les événements des avertissements personnels dont j’ai à dégager le sens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9644fdc9-a055-4724-b0c6-498fb2b5e88c",
                                                "sense_id": "3ed49ab0-109a-39b6-8bfd-a1f86c9cf37d",
                                                "text": "Pourtant je tiens jalousement à l’avertissement lancé par Homère aux Grecs dans L'Iliade et par Tyrtée dans les Élégies: « C'est une faiblesse déraisonnable que de se décharger sur la divinité de la responsabilité d'une morale et d'un ordre public » — Dieu, Allah ou quel qu'il soit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "220fc971-5b6e-3a77-9470-ddd2d32e40fa",
                                        "entry_id": "7dfebd23-d646-3dfd-a082-68bb7bb10e5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Titre d’une espèce de petite préface mise à la tête d’un livre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d34f5b1-cfa9-4a7e-937a-1286ed05fae2",
                                                "sense_id": "220fc971-5b6e-3a77-9470-ddd2d32e40fa",
                                                "text": "Avertissement de l’éditeur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e66d07a-fc56-3027-903b-6eb7a617a7a0",
                                        "entry_id": "7dfebd23-d646-3dfd-a082-68bb7bb10e5f",
                                        "glosses": [
